Subtasks are a fork of the format
[ ] Ship the release
  [x] Write the notes
  [x] Tag the commit
  [ ] Publish
[x] Tidy the office
  [x] Move the plants
  [x] Find whose mug that is

Indent with two spaces or more, or a tab
[ ] Any depth works
  [ ] Two spaces
      [ ] Six more
          [ ] And deeper still

A subtask keeps its own due date
[ ] Parent -> 2026-12-31
  [ ] Child has its own -> 2026-08-14
  [ ] So does this one -> 2026-09-01

Description continuations still work
[ ] This one has a description ...
    ... continued on the next line
  [ ] and a subtask under that
